    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm feeling really weird right now. my chest feels kind of tight, like there’s a heavy pressure right in the middle, and my left arm feels all tingly and numb. i've been super stressed at work lately so maybe it's just anxiety? i don't want to freak out but it's kinda scary.",
