      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a relief to hear it might be something like a pinched nerve or just the stress. i was really worried it was my heart. do you think i should just take some calming tea or maybe some extra magnesium to help me relax and see if the pressure goes away? i really don't want to go to the ER if i don't have to, it's just so expensive and time consuming.",
