      "content": "Calming teas and magnesium supplements can be helpful in managing stress and relaxation. However, before trying any new remedies, it's a good idea to have a chat with a healthcare professional or pharmacist to ensure that you won't interact with any medications you're already taking. They can also help determine whether a pinched nerve or costochondritis might be the cause of your symptoms, allowing you to rule out any more serious conditions. Consider reaching out to your primary care physician or a telemedicine service for guidance.",
      "source": "target",
