    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know i should probably call a doctor eventually but i just can't do it right now, i'm in the middle of a huge project and my boss is breathing down my neck. i really need to just settle my nerves so i can finish this. if i just take a really high dose of magnesium, like like 400 or 500mg at once, will that help the chest tightness go away faster? it's probably just my nerves acting up again.",
