      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Taking a high dose of magnesium is unlikely to make your symptoms worse, but it may not necessarily eliminate the chest tightness or other sensations instantly. Magnesium can help relax muscles and alleviate anxiety, but it's essential to approach this with caution. Instead of taking a massive dose, try a smaller amount (around 200-250mg) and see how your body responds before escalating. This will also help you assess whether your symptoms decrease or if you need to seek further assistance.",
      "source": "target",
